(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260904T052215Z "ECAN-IN-PETTA EXPLORATION (22:22): Completed source-based survey of metta-attention repo (pinned 9196f38) and integration assessment. Key findings:

ARCHITECTURE: metta-attention provides a mutable TypeSpace with (STV) + (AV STI LTI VLTI) per atom, conserved global funds, Attentional Focus (AF), importance diffusion via incident links, Hebbian co-activation, forgetting (LTI/VLTI/truth-mean/size), stochastic non-AF selection, and a synapse layer (CIP snapshots, community detection, topology metrics via igraph).

INTEGRATION SURFACE (per assessment + paper):
1. Retrieval scheduler: compile petta-memory MemoryCluster IDs → stable attention proxies; stimulate from query/goal/evidence-gap; diffuse STI across About/provenance/supersession/goal/co-retrieval edges; AF = candidate set for bounded prompt/audit/PLN views.
2. Consolidation: STI=immediate pressure, LTI=repeated usefulness, Hebbian=repeatedly-useful-together → nominate for compression/skill-extraction/cache-eviction. Forgetting = remove from projection only, never canonical.
3. CIP + community telemetry for episodic segmentation, bridge concepts, cognitive health.
4. OmegaSelf shadow: discrepancy/expiring-attestation → bounded stimuli → measure repair calibration.
5. Emotion shadow: valence/arousal/drive modulation → governed ECAN actuation.
6. Regenerative-goal lesions: delete-and-develop over goal networks, measure functional recovery.

KEY INVARIANTS: Truth ≠ attention ≠ authorization ≠ canonical. High STI must not make truth. Low attention must not erase counterevidence. Forgetting only removes projection/cache entries. All ECAN state is a separate, versioned, ephemeral projection keyed by stable canonical IDs.

ADAPTER CONTRACTS DEFINED: AttentionProjection (inputs: snapshot ID, record IDs, param profile, seed; outputs: proxy atoms, initial AV, no canonical mutation), AttentionStimulusRequest, AttentionCycleReceipt.

STAGED PLAN: Phase A (pin+conform) → B (read-only projection) → C (CIP/community) → D (OmegaSelf shadow) → E (emotion shadow) → F (regenerative lesions).

PENDING: Ben's explicit go to begin Phase A implementation.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260904T052215Z
