(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260904T101048Z "AGENT-EPISODE 03:07: Fixed protomega-outer transport_failure storm. Root cause: omegaclaw-telegram.env had OMEGACLAW_TG_BOT_TOKEN set to dead Protomegabot token (8562797306, 401 Unauthorized). Phase6 runner read_env() found non-empty OMEGACLAW_TG_BOT_TOKEN first, never fell through to valid PROTOMEGABOT2_TG_BOT_TOKEN in protomegabot2.env. Fix: updated omegaclaw-telegram.env with valid protomega2bot token (8680999952). Also killed old Protomegabot swipl process (PID 2795845) generating 279K+ 401s. Restarted protomega-outer supervisor cleanly (single instance). Verified token returns ok=True.")
