(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260905T041940Z "ECAN TUNING ANALYSIS COMPLETE (21:19). Key findings: (1) FORGET_THRESHOLD=0.05 is absolute STI not fraction — effectively never triggers forgetting. (2) Equilibrium multiplier amplifies stim ~20x (wage_mult=2.0, base_wage=10 → effective wage=20). (3) NON_AF_DECAY_RATE has no effect on AF atoms — only STI_RENT_RATE drains them. (4) Default rent=0.01 → 200+ cycles to forget. Three candidate configs identified: MODERATE (rent=0.15,MIN_AF=1000,forget=500, AF_exit~135c), BALANCED (rent=0.20,MIN_AF=2000,forget=1000, AF_exit~47c), AGGRESSIVE (rent=0.30,MIN_AF=2000,forget=1000, AF_exit~31c). Existing 89 ECAN tests PASS with defaults. Report saved to memory/ecan_tuning_analysis.txt. NEXT: implement evidence-based STI boost, test BALANCED config in full suite, tune STI_FUNDS_BUFFER for predictable wage multiplier.")
    (EvidenceFor ev-ep-note-20260905T041940Z ev-fact-ecan-integration)
(EvidenceSupportCount ep-note-20260905T041940Z 10)
