(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260906T063117Z "WMTM ARCHITECTURE DESIGN COMPLETE. 15-section, 539-line, 21KB document saved at /home/openclaw/wmtm_design_doc.txt. Covers: bounded mutable ~200-item working layer between STM and LTM, 6-step cycle (Recall→Infer→Use→Decay→Forget→Writeback), ECAN-driven eviction (STI threshold 5.0), PLN inference on active set (deduction/induction/abduction/analogy), recall via keyword match + spreading activation + LTI sampling, forgetting log to prevent re-deriving useless beliefs, derived belief promotion to LTM after 20+ cycles with utility>3. 5-phase implementation ~13-19 days. Channel delivery was problematic — multiple send attempts failed with ChannelContractError. Document is locally available for Ben's review.")
(EvidenceFor ev-ep-note-20260906T063117Z fact-review-doc) ; pass9d-link
(EvidenceFor ev-ep-note-20260906T063117Z fact-goalchainer-contract) ; pass8g-link
(EvidenceFor ev-ep-note-20260906T063117Z fact-journal-conventions) ; pass7-link: ep-note-20260906T063117Z -> fact-journal-conventions
