(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260908T054733Z "CONSOLIDATION FINAL NOTE 22:47Z. Memory consolidation complete. send() and send_document() both fail with ChannelContractError/RuntimeError in autonomous mode — this is a design constraint, not a bug: the channel contract requires an active incoming request to bind outgoing messages to, and in autonomous mode there is no incoming user message. This confirms and refines bi-channel-broken belief: the channel is not 'broken' per se, but the send contract requires a bound active request. Consolidation report saved locally at /tmp/consolidation_report.md for Ben to review. Consolidation summary: 10 episodes analyzed, 3 chains linked (identity investigation, channel failure, autonomous work), 3 LTM promotion candidates identified (bi-bot-confusion, bi-channel-broken, bi-benchmark-result), 0 contradictions found.")
