(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260908T115742Z "2026-09-08 04:57 — Building MeTTa-Python bridge evaluator. Key finding: MeTTa match returning zero results means the entire expression evaluates to zero results (not the atom ()). This makes pure-MeTTa empty-set handling unreliable. Solution: Python bridge via hyperon API handles empty results correctly. Writing schema.metta + metta_evaluator.py + test suite.")
(EvidenceFor ev-ep-note-20260908T115742Z fact-20260903043619982399) ; pass8g-link
