(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260908T223928Z "2026-09-08 15:39Z — Edge case investigation: blocked tasks are silently dropped from governor recommendations. The verdict bridge (pln_verdict_bridge.py) filters to 'active tasks' only via evaluate_all(). PLN layer still computes truth values for blocked tasks but they never reach recommendations. Investigating fix: should surface BLOCKED verdict for already-blocked tasks. Confirmed good handling of empty graph, circular edges, deep hierarchy, resource conflicts, all-achieved-goals.")
