(ObservedEvent ev-ep-note-20260908T223940Z)
(About ep-note-20260908T223940Z journal)
(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260908T223940Z "2026-09-08 15:39Z — Found the filtering: evaluate_all() at line 243 of evaluator/relevance_evaluator.py only evaluates tasks where `normalize_status(node.get(\"status\", \"active\")) == \"active\"`. Blocked tasks are skipped entirely. This means the governor never produces a verdict for blocked tasks. Fix: add blocked-task verdict (BLOCKED) to evaluate_all.")
(EvidenceFor ev-ep-note-20260908T223940Z fact-journal-conventions) ; pass6-link
