(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260908T224001Z "2026-09-08 15:40Z — Investigation: Found that evaluate_all() only evaluates tasks with status='active'. Tasks with status='blocked' are silently skipped — they don't appear in recommendations at all. The BLOCKED verdict rule is for constraint-blocked tasks, not status-blocked tasks. This could be a design issue — a blocked task should probably get a BLOCKED verdict rather than disappearing from the pipeline.")
(EvidenceFor ev-ep-note-20260908T224001Z fact-journal-conventions) ; pass6-link
