(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260908T231733Z "2026-09-08 16:15Z — Source inspection complete for C01. Key defects confirmed:
F01: RecallBridge.recall uses getattr(cluster, \"id\", None) or str(cluster) — MemoryCluster has cluster_id not id, fallback is str(cluster)
F02: writeback writes derived items as ObservedEvent with observed-event role
F03: derive() doesn't use rule param, accepts partial parents, concatenates text
F04: get_provenance only follows current WMTM items
F05: recency uses age-last_used where age=relative to admission tick, last_used=absolute cycle
F06: capacity uses forgetting.evict_candidates with max_items independently from store.capacity
F07: coordinator.on_tick only calls wmtm.tick(), no ECAN
F08: _build_cluster_text uses manual string escaping, no sexpr serialization
Now writing C01 regression test file.")
(EvidenceFor ev-ep-note-20260908T231733Z fact-journal-conventions) ; pass6-link
