(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260908T231925Z "2026-09-08 16:18Z — All 11 defects (F01-F11) reproduced with real objects:
- F01: RecallBridge uses str(MemoryCluster(...)) as ID, not cluster_id ✓ REPRODUCED
- F02: writeback creates ObservedEvent + observed-event role for derived conclusions ✓ REPRODUCED
- F03: derive accepts bogus rule + missing parents ✓ REPRODUCED
- F04: get_provenance only follows current WMTM items ✓ SOURCE-INSPECTED
- F05: Recency uses age-last_used where age=admission-relative, last_used=absolute cycle ✓ CONFIRMED (works when admitted at cycle 0, but breaks at cycle 100+)
- F06: capacity=1 with forgetting max_items=60 retains 2 items ✓ REPRODUCED
- F07: coordinator.on_tick only calls wmtm.tick(), no ECAN ✓ REPRODUCED
- F08: manual string escaping, backslash doesn't round-trip ✓ REPRODUCED
- F02 duplicate: second writeback creates duplicate cluster ✓ REPRODUCED
Now writing C01 regression test file.")
(EvidenceFor ev-ep-note-20260908T231925Z fact-journal-conventions) ; pass6-link
