petta-memory WMTM: Ben posted 6 remaining defects. On fix/wmtm-defects-v3 branch. Starting systematic analysis and fix work.
Next: fix F05 recency, writeback dedup, serialization, ECAN, provenance/identity, and correct tests that assert defective behavior.")
