(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260909T115246Z "2026-09-09T04:53Z Confirmed D03 (spreading activation ID mismatch) is STILL UNFIXED on main. spreading_activation() receives cluster IDs as seed_ids but adjacency is built from evidence_map keyed by belief IDs. BFS finds 0 neighbors. Need to add cluster→belief ID resolution at the start of spreading_activation, similar to the _resolve_belief_ids fix in wmtm_utility.py for D02.")
