(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260909T120011Z "2026-09-09T04:59Z D03 BUG CONFIRMED: spreading_activation() BFS starts with cluster IDs (mc-a, mc-b) from recall(), but adjacency is built from evidence_map keyed by belief IDs (belief-a, belief-b). adjacency.get('mc-a') returns [] → 0 neighbors found → spreading activation is a no-op. Fix: add cluster→belief ID resolution at BFS start, and belief/event→cluster ID resolution at admission time.")
