(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260910T025929Z "PR#345 OmegaClaw-Core import fix (2026-09-09):
- channels/__init__.py re-exports CommChannel from src/channels.py via importlib
- conftest.py adds ., channels/, Autotests/ to sys.path[0], src at end
- pyproject.toml: pythonpath = [\"src\", \".\"] (reversed order for pytest's insert-at-0)
- Run with: PYTHONPATH=.:src --override-ini=\"pythonpath=\" 
- test_chat_room_identity_v2.py BROKEN: imports channels.telegram which imports from message_envelope (module doesn't exist - governance branch bug)
- origin/main's telegram.py uses import channels, from src.logger etc (works fine)
- HEAD telegram.py is completely rewritten (1817 line diff from origin/main)
- Unit tests + protocol tests: 42 passed, 6 skipped
- Slow MeTTa/SWI-Prolog tests blocked by petta-chem CPU contention")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260910T025929Z
