(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260910T070818Z "07:06Z Sep 10 — STATUS: 4505/8832 (51.0%). 9/32 complete (g1001-g1009). 8 runners: g1010:265, g1011:257, g1012:232, g1013:233, g1014:152, g1015:124, g1016:126, g1017:33. 16 swipl procs. Load 17.1. Launcher alive 15h. KEY FINDING: g1010 and g1011 have HIGH receipt counts across all attempts (265 and 257 best) but the running attempt-003 processes are only at 25-26 receipts. This means the old attempts accumulated receipts but the current a003 processes are slow. g1014-g1016 at 124-152 — making slow progress. g1017 at 33 — very slow. g1018-g1032 not started (launcher running_seeds=8 > MAX_CONCURRENT=6, blocking new launches). ISSUE: Auto-launcher counts swipl procs with graph-seed-10 pattern — matches g1010-g1019 (10 seeds!) not unique running. Bug in grep pattern. Also: 16 swipl procs for 8 runners (2 per seed) — launcher counts them as unique seeds via sort -u on the seed number extracted.")
