(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260910T071141Z "CONSOLIDATION COMPLETE 00:09Z Sep 10. ROOT CAUSE: orchestrator_state.json has frozen['1010'] as STRING (set manually by g1010_resume_watcher), but orchestrator.py line 312 does frozen[key].get('reason') assuming dict → crashes. 5 LTM ITEMS: (1) Calibration 9/32 complete (g1001-g1009), NOT 10/32 — memory CONTRADICTED. (2) Orchestrator bug line 312 — frozen[key] type mismatch breaks processing of frozen seeds. (3) PR#345 open. (4) send() must be called alone. (5) Auto-launcher running_seeds=8 despite MAX_CONCURRENT=6. FIXES NEEDED: orchestrator.py line 312, auto_launch concurrency, orchestrator_state.json frozen['1010'] type. NEXT: Apply fixes, monitor g1010/g1011, check PR#345.")
