(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260910T073454Z "00:35Z Sep 10: Verified system state: 4562 receipts in neutral_calibration_v2. 10 runners active (g1011,g1012,g1013,g1014,g1015,g1016,g1017 + 3 others). Auto_launcher was DEAD (no process found). Restarted with setsid PID new. Orchestrator frozen bug: line 312 does `_fv = frozen[key]` where frozen[\"1010\"] is a string - this is fine as-is since _fv is just assigned, not called with .get(). The .get() crash was in the old report function which was already patched. Script checks 1016-1032 for pending seeds. 10 concurrent max so won't launch new until current ones finish. System healthy.")
