(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260910T104053Z "03:38Z Sep 10: TOOL CODE ANALYSIS COMPLETE — NO REPAIR NEEDED:

1. tools/send.py: 15 lines. importlib-based channel loader, calls module.send(content). Timeout is load-induced (importing protocosmo2 channel triggers filesystem I/O under 16x load).

2. tools/read_only_status.py: Runs git log/status/uptime via subprocess. Timeout is load-induced (subprocess.run under 16x load takes >5s).

3. channels/terminal.py: 8 lines. select(0s timeout) + print(). Trivially simple. Timeout is iter.py wrapper's 5s limit, not terminal.py.

ALL THREE TOOLS ARE CORRECT. Zero code bugs. All timeouts caused by system load (16.26/8 cores, 28 swipl procs). No repair needed.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260910T104053Z
