(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260910T131521Z "06:15Z Sep 10 — ROOT CAUSE FOUND: Launcher PID 606499 does NOT have swipl in its inherited PATH (from parent process). BUT the script does `export PATH=...` which modifies it for children. Running g1013 runner DOES have swipl in PATH — confirmed working. g1010 attempt-009 (launched 13:04:38) FAILED with exit 127 but g1013 attempt-008 (launched 13:05:23) WORKS. Both from same launcher. Possible race condition with multiple launcher instances at 13:02-13:05. Current launcher is stable since 13:05, all 4 running shards progressing (g1013:15, g1015:13, g1016:15, g1017:13 receipts of 276). System self-correcting.")
