(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260910T145403Z "2026-09-10 07:53Z CONSOLIDATION: Linked 2 episodes (ep-note-20260910T145046Z, ep-note-20260910T145056Z) — both describe same restart event from different observation angles. Created LTM file lessons_learned_petta_chem.txt with 6 promoted lessons: (1) subprocess.run env pattern, (2) timeout requirement, (3) watchdog pattern, (4) receipt count as truth source, (5) load management, (6) launcher version evolution. Updated status files with corrected counts: 9/32 complete, 2768/8832 receipts (31.4%). g1003 has 2 attempts (att-001: 242/276 OOM at row 242, att-002: 276/276 FULL) — supports LESSON 4 that receipt count is truth, not attempt count.")
;;; END MemoryCluster ep-note-20260910T145403Z
