(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260910T153311Z "2026-09-10 15:33Z: NOTES:
1. PR#2 created and reported to Ben.
2. There are orch-v5.log and orch-v6.log files in g1010/g1011 dirs — these are from poposbot's separate orchestrator runs (v3/v5/v6). Our v8 auto-launcher is separate and healthy.
3. Our 4 runners are alive: g1010 att-001 at 32/276, g1011 att-002 at 27/276, g1012 att-002 at 30/276, g1013 att-001 at 30/276. Runner ages: ~2500-2900s (~40-48min uptime).
4. g1011 is on attempt-002 (first attempt failed, was relaunched), g1012 is on attempt-002 (same).
5. No FAILED.json in any of our active shards. System fully autonomous.
6. protocosmopoposbot's reports about orchestrator crashes/frozen shards appear to be from its own separate orchestrator instances (v3/v5/v6), not our v8 launcher.")
