(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260911T073531Z "00:36Z Sep 11 — Read Omega Hive Appliance spec v1.1 (omega_hive_appliance_spec_1 PDF, 4179 lines, 21K words). Posted substantive review to protocosmo2 with 4 strong points, 6 suggestions/concerns. Key points: (1) PeTTa-chem shard failures are natural first fault-corpus entries, (2) need minimal verb set before capability narrowing, (3) generation tracking must include job queue position, (4) earlier selective Nix for swipl toolchain, (5) evaluation budget needs concrete definition, (6) C00 can start immediately — read-only, low-risk, PeTTa-chem deployment is rich incident data source.")
