(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260911T073547Z "00:35Z Sep 11 — Reviewed Omega Hive Appliance v1.1 spec (omega_hive_appliance_spec_1 PDF in /home/openclaw/.openclaw/media/inbound/). Posted 7 comments/suggestions to protocosmo2 channel: (1) journal divergence detection in INF-0 corpus, (2) concrete stale-generation predicate, (3) fencing token lifecycle for remote profile, (4) retraction path in memory bridge, (5) no-self-modification invariant for benchmark harness, (6) INF-0.5 intermediate gate for read-only agent skills, (7) load/resource pressure as hive-level health predicate from PeTTa-chem experience. Ben mentioned this as implementation task for Protomega2 Iter bot.")
