(EventNote ev-ep-note-20260911T082906Z "08:28Z Sep 11 — OCR FAILED: TrOCR-base-printed produces garbage on the inbound JPG (1232x1018, 40.8% colored pixels, green elements). Multiple preprocessing attempts (adaptive threshold, contrast enhancement, line-by-line cropping, 3x upscale) all returned nonsensical text like \"THERE WHEN THE ACCESS IS INE.\" The image likely contains diagrams/charts/UI elements that TrOCR can't handle. Tesseract not installable (no sudo). Load spiked to 10+ during OCR attempts, now recovering (8.46). Calibration stable: 3478 receipts, 5 swipl, 2 recent in 5min. Need user to describe image contents or provide alternative OCR method.")
